(l) “person” includes—
(i) an individual;
(ii) a Hindu undivided family;
(iii) a company;
(iv) a firm;
(v) an association of persons or a body of individuals,
 whether incorporated or not, in India or outside India;
(vi) any corporation established by or under any
 Central, State or
Provincial Act
or a Government
 company as defined in
section 617
